    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthwave Burnout VR</strong> is an explosive arcade racing game in VR, inspired by the aesthetics of the \u201980s and synthwave style. Strap on your headset, rev your engine, and blaze through neon-soaked tracks where every move, turn, and crash feels like you\u2019re in the heart of a glowing retro-futuristic storm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726570/extras/e78ad7e1affbf68af816686b173db563.avif?t=1751398080\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><strong>Style</strong><br>In VR, the neon-soaked aesthetics of the \u201980s feel more vivid than ever. Dark tracks, pulsating horizons, flickering stars, and hypnotic lights surround you from all sides. Every flash, reflection, and shadow comes to life in immersive virtual reality. A powerful electronic soundtrack and rich spatial audio complete the experience, pulling you deeper into the retro-futuristic world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726570/extras/503db7571b5969a310f526a4b80dc946.avif?t=1751398080\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Take control of 6 unique vehicles using your VR controllers \u2014 steer the wheel, hit the gas, dodge obstacles, and smash into rivals. Each of the 6 levels offers fresh sensations, visual tricks, and unique challenges. Swerve, evade, and ram with real physical movement and full concentration. Don\u2019t just watch the race \u2014 become part of it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726570/extras/7614fe55a011c9cb2649edee05e2d8e5.avif?t=1751398080\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>VR Features</strong><br>\u25cf Full VR immersion with in-game camera, intuitive controls, and a realistic sense of speed<br>\u25cf 6 vibrant levels with unique visual effects<br>\u25cf Atmospheric synthwave soundtracks and spatial audio<br>\u25cf 6 unique vehicles with detailed VR interiors and distinct handling systems<br>\u25cf Fast-paced races packed with rival competitors<br>\u25cf Extra challenges and objectives on every level<br>\u25cf Spectacular crashes and a detailed damage system</p>",
